		"Details": "The Menace is a newly created BattleMech developed by Clan Fire Mandrill to celebrate their arrival in the Inner Sphere in the early 3060s. In the traditional Fire Mandrill way, the Menace was the subject of a lot of inter-clan trials to determine which kindraa would be the one to debut the design. In another traditional Fire Mandrill twist, these trials ended up only ensuring all the kindraas had access to the design. The Menace is built on a 340-rated XL fusion engine and an Endo-Steel frame for maximum free weight for the weapon load. The aforementioned weapon load is a simple, clean, but very powerful pair each of ER PPCs for direct fire and Streak LRM-20s for ranged support. For extra protection the Menace carries an ECM Suite and 18 DHS keep it all frosty.",
